path: README.md

```markdown
# LLM-Train: Ultra-Long Context 1T Parameter Training System

## Prerequisites

- CUDA Toolkit 12.8+
- NVIDIA Driver R570+
- Zig 0.13.0
- CMake 3.20+
- NCCL 2.21+
- 8x NVIDIA B200 GPUs (192GB HBM3e each)

## Build

```bash
cd kernels/cuda && mkdir build && cd build && cmake -DCMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES=100 .. && make -j$(nproc) && cd ../../..
zig build -Doptimize=ReleaseFast
```

## Train

```bash
./zig-out/bin/llm-train train --config configs/model_1t.zig --data-path /data/tokens --checkpoint-dir ./ckpt --gpus 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7
```

## Resume

```bash
./zig-out/bin/llm-train train --resume ./ckpt/step_50000 --data-path /data/tokens --checkpoint-dir ./ckpt --gpus 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7
```

## Tokenizer

```bash
./zig-out/bin/llm-train tokenizer train --corpus /data/text.txt --vocab-size 50000 --output tokenizer.model
./zig-out/bin/llm-train tokenizer encode --model tokenizer.model --input text.txt --output tokens.bin
./zig-out/bin/llm-train tokenizer decode --model tokenizer.model --input tokens.bin --output decoded.txt
```

## Smoke Test

```bash
bash scripts/run_local_smoke.sh
```

## Modal Cloud

```bash
cd cloud/modal && pip install modal && modal deploy train_app.py && modal run launcher.py --config ../../configs/model_1t.zig
```

## Profile

```bash
bash scripts/profile.sh
```

## Test

```bash
zig build test
```
```

